    html: |
      <section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="split"><div class="split-media reveal"><img src="assets/img/dest-xian.png" alt="Xi'an" /><div class="seal-stamp" aria-hidden="true">西<br/>&#28216;</div></div><div class="split-copy reveal reveal-d1"><span class="eyebrow">Ancient Wonders</span><h2 class="display-h2">Why visit Xi'an?</h2><p>Xi'an was China's capital for 13 dynasties and the eastern terminus of the Silk Road. Today it is a living museum where terracotta warriors stand guard, city walls encircle a vibrant Muslim Quarter, and the scent of cumin and lamb drifts from charcoal grills at dusk.</p></div></div></div></section>
