      <section class="section" style="background:var(--white);"><div class="container"><div class="section-head reveal"><span class="eyebrow centered">Must-See Sights</span><h2 class="display-h2">Iconic experiences in Xi'an</h2></div><div class="feature-grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);"><div class="card feature-card reveal"><div class="feature-icon"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg></div><h3>Terracotta Army</h3><p>Over 8,000 life-sized clay soldiers, each face unique, guarding Emperor Qin Shi Huang's tomb for 2,200 years. We arrive at opening time for an uncrowded experience.</p></div><div class="card feature-card reveal"><div class="feature-icon"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg></div><h3>Ancient City Wall</h3><p>One of the best-preserved city walls in China. Cycle the 14 km circuit at golden hour for panoramic views.</p></div><div class="card feature-card reveal"><div class="feature-icon"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg></div><h3>Muslim Quarter</h3><p>A maze of lantern-lit streets where Hui Muslim culture thrives. Graze on roujiamo, biangbiang noodles, and pomegranate juice.</p></div><div class="card feature-card reveal"><div class="feature-icon"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg></div><h3>Big Wild Goose Pagoda</h3><p>A 7th-century Buddhist pagoda and its surrounding gardens — peaceful at dusk.</p></div></div></div></section>
